Package: typebyvoice
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libopus0, libopusfile0, libpulse0
Maintainer: Type by Voice <support@typebyvoice.example>
Description: Dictate into any application
 Type by Voice records from the microphone, streams the audio to the shared
 backend for transcription, and inserts the text at the cursor. A single-instance
 tray agent with a global shortcut and a floating status pill.
